sequenceDiagram
  participant R as GeoReasoner
  participant G as project.gpkg
  participant U as Reviewer (dock)
  R->>G: lithology rows (unit, p, evidence,<br/>needs_review, review_reason) + unit_runs
  U->>G: Accept proposal "LMBE" (reason, name, time)<br/>review_decisions
  U->>G: Override BH10 15.1-27.0 m = HWH<br/>lithology.override_unit + review_decisions
  Note over G: issue status edits (accepted / dismissed) kept in issues.status
  R->>G: next run reads overrides and acceptances
  alt proposal unchanged
    R->>G: flag cleared, "accepted by <name>"
  else proposal changed by new data
    R->>G: flag re-opened, "re-review: interpretation changed"
  end
